{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/r6RGngGEZmqQlCcrxExGrw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:05.004682+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/r6RGngGEZmqQlCcrxExGrw","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MVPvEL7Qg0Gjib4O8YLPM4h30DCQvwP7E9ZIWgMEcygMfOy3F7YjUiaHOLl7tlg9icOuJP9DzFUD2xTcpHB8GNMJQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b>夏</b></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong>令</strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>营</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>为促进全国高校2026年优秀应届本科毕业生之间的交流，增进对我单位研究生教育的深入了解，激发同学们对新材料、新能源领域的兴趣，鼓励将来申请我单位推荐免试研究生，特举办本次夏令营活动。报名阶段相关事宜通知如下 ：</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/RyQtNConrQLuibdicLCeURTgukeJ4Ohqudl5OI0D0xeJFv28iaZfHyphr6zsib1MQp1lfgxE7EGXXiblaFem7IEONIw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/RyQtNConrQLuibdicLCeURTgukeJ4OhqudicU9faJjzFvnzo6FjWugJRyO78ibYoPLp9QZEg9py8393QC0iaIMt1RLg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/iagk1ibLIibBWyhU8zS3rUXs8sQyoxBTJ2QNFDfiaz1WNC8DE6TZoweLRdIuO2hspH6Lz2jd7zLou6aSYR4RCkj1ZQ/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><em><strong>1</strong></em></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>｜报名时间</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p>6月10日10:00-6月25日17:00</p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/iagk1ibLIibBWyhU8zS3rUXs8sQyoxBTJ2QNFDfiaz1WNC8DE6TZoweLRdIuO2hspH6Lz2jd7zLou6aSYR4RCkj1ZQ/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><em><strong>2</strong></em></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>｜报名条件</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p>1.全国各高等学校2026年应届本科毕业生。</p><p>2.学业成绩优秀，预期可获得推荐免试资格。</p><p>3.具有较强的学术创新或实践应用能力。</p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/iagk1ibLIibBWyhU8zS3rUXs8sQyoxBTJ2QNFDfiaz1WNC8DE6TZoweLRdIuO2hspH6Lz2jd7zLou6aSYR4RCkj1ZQ/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><em><strong>3</strong></em></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>｜报名材料</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p>1.近期正面免冠彩色证件照片，电子版JPG格式，150×200像素，大小500K以内。</p><p>2.本科阶段现有完整成绩单（须加盖学校教务处或院系公章），JPG或PDF格式。</p><p>3.外语水平证明，如CET-4、CET-6、雅思、托福、专业外语成绩等。</p><p>4.有关获奖证书和学术科研成果，如发表论文、出版物或其他原创性工作。</p><p>5.诚信承诺书（可从报考服务系统下载，签名后上传）。</p><p>6.申请<strong>直博学生</strong>须提交专家推荐信2封。推荐专家应具有正高级职称及博士生导师资格。拟报考导师不得作为推荐专家。</p><p>7.申请<strong>直博学生</strong>须提交科研计划书。须在科研计划书封面写明报考的导师姓名。</p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/iagk1ibLIibBWyhU8zS3rUXs8sQyoxBTJ2QNFDfiaz1WNC8DE6TZoweLRdIuO2hspH6Lz2jd7zLou6aSYR4RCkj1ZQ/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><em><strong>4</strong></em></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>｜报名方式</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p>申请人登录复旦大学研究生招生网（https://gsao.fudan.edu.cn）,通过“研究生报考服务系统”中的“全国优秀大学生夏令营”进行网上报名。</p><p>本院无需考生寄送纸质材料。</p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/iagk1ibLIibBWyhU8zS3rUXs8sQyoxBTJ2QNFDfiaz1WNC8DE6TZoweLRdIuO2hspH6Lz2jd7zLou6aSYR4RCkj1ZQ/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><em><strong>5</strong></em></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>｜相关说明</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p>1.本次夏令营活动规模及举办时间、方式等，另行通知。</p><p>2.申请人应承诺填报信息和提交材料的真实性。如有弄虚作假，一经发现将取消申请资格并通报其本科院校。</p><p>3.有意报考我单位2026级推免研究生的同学（含本校本科生），应申请参加本次夏令营活动。我单位后期是否举办其他推免相关活动，另行通知。如果上级部门和学校关于夏令营活动有新要求，我单位将按新要求执行并及时通知申请人。</p><p>4.咨询方式：</p><p>材料学科：曾老师021-31243591，weizeng@fudan.edu.cn。</p><p>物理、化学学科：彭老师021-31249935，lam_gs@fudan.edu.cn</p></section></section></section><section><p>夏令营详情请见学院官网：</p><p>复旦大学智能材料与未来能源创新学院2025 年全国优秀大学生夏令营报名通知</p></section><section><p>复旦大学智能材料与未来能源创新学院</p><p>                                 2025年6月9日</p></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"8353f6ccf201fd2190672c67e414dbc29d027816d00a5be1e18171f1c0713825","textLength":926,"sourceSha256":"379ab730131c4f2f372504f0382d3267f05ec6b5db463cbbb068e2914bfc220b","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-f10507bfc44a0afc1c73","title":"2025年复旦大学智能材料与未来能源创新学院2025年全国优秀大学生夏令营报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:05.004682+00:00"}
